Total Enterprise Storage Systems Installed Base Expected to Grow at 30.9% CAGR between 2020–2025 What Do Represent All These Bytes? Home » Solid State (flash, SSD...), Memory... » Addlink: Up to 4TB PCIe Gen4x4 S92 SSD With Phison Controller and QLC NAND Addlink Technology introduces 1/2/4TB PCIe Gen4x4 QLC SSD that can reach speeds of 4.9GB/s for sequential reads and 3.8GB/s for sequential writes. The S92 SSD , a high-end NVMe PCIE Gen4x4 SSD, is for any heavy workloads task. Its target to professional designer, photographer, youtuber, or heavy game player. The S92 is with M.2 NVMe SSD Gen4x4 that can deliver at speed of up to 4.9GB/s for sequential reads and 3.6GB/s for sequential writes and hit upwards of random R/W speed of up to 350,000/700,000 IO/s. It is ready for AMD RYZEN 3 rd gen and compatible with most motherboards from major brands. With 3D QLC NAND storage technology, the S92 PCIe Gen 4×4 incorporates a high memory cell density, allowing for storage capacity on a smaller footprint – up to 4TB. And balance the performance and cost. It brings to the customer better performance, higher density, and endurance. It comes with Phison Electronics Corp. ‘ premium controller- PS5016-E16 to utilize QLC NAND flash and enable SSD capacity. It brings to the customer better performance, higher density, and reliable endurance. It supports ECC technology, Wear Leveling, Bad Block Management, and over-Provision features to guarantee the QLC SSD Reliability. The device also supports secure erase, TRIM and SMART commands to help customer can optimized and monitor their S92 SSD device. The Addlink S92 NVMe PCIe M.2 SSD come with warranty of 5 years and is available in three capacities: 1TB, 2TB and 4TB on Amazon . Click to enlarge Share this news : With all the daily news on the worldwide storage industry, StorageNewsletter is updated every day at 9AM in Chicago. Subscribe to our free daily newsletter CATEGORIES M&As Start-Ups Systems (RAID, NAS, SAN, Appliance) Financial 